Z||000000||triker||05-11-2000||07:02 PM||||What would happen if you put an 87 V6 auto chip in an 85 V6 auto?  Would it run?  And if it did, what problems or codes would have? ||||reg||5
Z||000001||theogre||05-11-2000||07:06 PM||||you can't put an 87 chip in an 85 ECM I don't think. They are not the same ECM inside even tho they may look it.||||reg||1
Z||000002||terryk||05-11-2000||11:07 PM||||No, you can't mix 85 and 86-88 ECM/chips.<P>The 85 is the 6869 and has different addresses from the 7170 used in the 86-88.<P>Same is true for the 2.5L.<P>||||reg||1
