Z||000005||cobra427||05-14-2000||12:11 AM||||terryk,you are right on with your #'s. Just to give it in a little more detail:<BR>1984-2.5 ECM #.....=1226156<BR>1985-86-2.5 ECM #..=1226864<BR>1987-88-2.5 ECM #..=1227748<P>1985-2.8 ECM #.....=1226869<BR>1986-88-2.8 ECM #..=1227170<P>Taken from 22P book<P>cobra||||reg||1
